{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港人最愛嘅3COINS 又有新產品啦！今次推出全新「Y2K復古電子產品系列」，全系列以千禧年懷舊風為主題，配上質感滿滿嘅灰紫、金屬銀與質感黑，真係好似返到2000年代咁！當中幾款兼具實用與打卡屬性嘅好物更是去日本必搶嘅首選。</p><p>首先係近年二手價格炒爆嘅「復古 CCD 相機」（約$180），支援影片拍攝、閃光燈、4倍變焦及定時拍攝，更內置9種濾鏡與11種相片貼紙。想要更多復古元素，有「串珠電話繩」！除了掛喺手機，仲能自由DIY裝飾相機、耳機盒或手袋～</p><p>另外有「懷舊透明 CD 播放機」（約$340），精緻小巧嘅透明掀蓋設計能直接欣賞 CD 旋轉，更內置喇叭與藍牙功能，兼具實體 CD 播放與手機連線播歌功能，擺喺房間裝飾都好靚！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862401832465371_20974354056a9c3c93ef448.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862402244077324_14093633706a9c3c97ba63f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862402538645170_9198777126a9c3c99e22d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862402737231098_5604251476a9c3c9c195fb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862402962411231_16212006636a9c3c9e112e8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862403172257747_2422612076a9c3ca03a516.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178862403344150982_424640836a9c3ca1d0d2d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T16:15:47.987848+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":388,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}